# Check out every file exactly as committed, on every OS. Git for Windows
# (and the Windows CI runner) defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which turns the
# desktop app's bundled resources into CRLF, so its build no longer matches a
# release built elsewhere (see "Verifying Reproducibility of Amber Desktop").
* -text
# cmd.exe can misread labels in LF batch files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
